{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Phantom Squad</i> drops you into the chaos of top-down tactical combat, blending methodical planning with fast-paced gunfights. Play as a team of 1-4 players, navigating brutal missions where every choice counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plan Your Strike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use voice chat and in-game tools to coordinate your approach. Move fast and adapt as things change; the enemy won\u2019t hesitate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841770/extras/68056ab66eee1bea415924fa3fe943c3.poster.avif?t=1756827971\" width=800 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841770/extras/68056ab66eee1bea415924fa3fe943c3.webm?t=1756827971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841770/extras/68056ab66eee1bea415924fa3fe943c3.mp4?t=1756827971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense Gunfights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the shooting starts, every bullet counts. Miss your target and you won\u2019t get a second chance. One shot can make or break your mission. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841770/extras/003e7273f5703a142ccffe20e4f52af1.poster.avif?t=1756827971\" width=800 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841770/extras/003e7273f5703a142ccffe20e4f52af1.webm?t=1756827971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841770/extras/003e7273f5703a142ccffe20e4f52af1.mp4?t=1756827971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Gear Up To Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Firepower isn\u2019t enough. Use over 20 specialized gadgets (scouting devices, incapacitating equipment, heartbeat sensors, breaching tools, traps and more) to gain the edge. Master them or get left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841770/extras/075f4c8187a96e3358a636426a4208ab.poster.avif?t=1756827971\" width=800 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841770/extras/075f4c8187a96e3358a636426a4208ab.webm?t=1756827971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841770/extras/075f4c8187a96e3358a636426a4208ab.mp4?t=1756827971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Tactical Planning:</strong> Mark routes, objectives and entry points as the mission unfolds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friendly Fire:</strong> One wrong shot could take down a friendly. Stay sharp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Combat:</strong> Precision gunfights where mistakes mean death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specialized Gear:</strong> Outthink, outmaneuver and outgun your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Threat:</strong> Your missions will lead you through downtown buildings, jungle compounds, arctic labs, ...</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-Op Teamwork:</strong> Squad up with 3 other players, each with a role, to execute perfect strategies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No backup. No rules. Just your squad and survival. Are you ready?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Phantom Squad</strong></i> is inspired by some amazing games: <i><strong>Doorkickers</strong></i>, <i><strong>Ready or Not</strong></i>, <strong><i>Rainbow Six Siege</i></strong> and many other amazing tactical shooters! Check them out too if you haven't already!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Die Hard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2841770/fd7a2a5c607058d9e1de74f836e237bff54b3ea2.jpg"},{"name":"Power Down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2841770/8937a16574a5d8b507b2f7ed5df3bfd65f8ed428.jpg"},{"name":"Olympus Strike","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2841770/c893c1eb56867182561fccd9fb0d4327c6d6c883.jpg"},{"name":"Deadwire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2841770/c539c8654db9d7e07d3c339da4114daf835b26fa.jpg"},{"name":"Chemist Abduction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2841770/359415b1176dbe24215d5de9621f9e72732d12a0.jpg"},{"name":"Chainbreaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2841770/98694a42eb83c3f6e983fd8301e51a031280ba49.jpg"},{"name":"Party Hard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2841770/5a75684a41e7ea9a809c7104b8883a1242999902.jpg"},{"name":"Stealth Lab","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2841770/29864d177d64d3956f5f62d3d9586accd78899b6.jpg"},{"name":"Embassy Tension","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2841770/21fa5d653c953fca408ebe6b96a2d4152ca537a0.jpg"},{"name":"Ghost Walker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2841770/f569c34f0617262f63ebf3aef045411377c8bce4.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2841770?t=1756827971","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841770/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756827971","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841770/c871835fca77a36a46b7aa533e89a367b218335a/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1756827971","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841770/c871835fca77a36a46b7aa533e89a367b218335a/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1756827971","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Phantom Squad features intense violence, strong language and mature themes. Players engage in realistic tactical combat, including graphic depictions of injury and death. The game explores themes of betrayal, survival and moral ambiguity, with a focus on strategic planning and teamwork under high-stress conditions."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Phantom Squad</i> drops you into the chaos of top-down tactical combat, blending methodical planning with fast-paced gunfights. Play as a team of 1-4 players, navigating brutal missions where every choice counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plan Your Strike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use voice chat and in-game tools to coordinate your approach. Move fast and adapt as things change; the enemy won\u2019t hesitate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841770/extras/68056ab66eee1bea415924fa3fe943c3.poster.avif?t=1756827971\" width=800 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841770/extras/68056ab66eee1bea415924fa3fe943c3.webm?t=1756827971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841770/extras/68056ab66eee1bea415924fa3fe943c3.mp4?t=1756827971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense Gunfights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the shooting starts, every bullet counts. Miss your target and you won\u2019t get a second chance. One shot can make or break your mission. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841770/extras/003e7273f5703a142ccffe20e4f52af1.poster.avif?t=1756827971\" width=800 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841770/extras/003e7273f5703a142ccffe20e4f52af1.webm?t=1756827971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841770/extras/003e7273f5703a142ccffe20e4f52af1.mp4?t=1756827971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Gear Up To Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Firepower isn\u2019t enough. Use over 20 specialized gadgets (scouting devices, incapacitating equipment, heartbeat sensors, breaching tools, traps and more) to gain the edge. Master them or get left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841770/extras/075f4c8187a96e3358a636426a4208ab.poster.avif?t=1756827971\" width=800 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841770/extras/075f4c8187a96e3358a636426a4208ab.webm?t=1756827971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841770/extras/075f4c8187a96e3358a636426a4208ab.mp4?t=1756827971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Tactical Planning:</strong> Mark routes, objectives and entry points as the mission unfolds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friendly Fire:</strong> One wrong shot could take down a friendly. Stay sharp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Combat:</strong> Precision gunfights where mistakes mean death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specialized Gear:</strong> Outthink, outmaneuver and outgun your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Threat:</strong> Your missions will lead you through downtown buildings, jungle compounds, arctic labs, ...</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-Op Teamwork:</strong> Squad up with 3 other players, each with a role, to execute perfect strategies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No backup. No rules. Just your squad and survival. Are you ready?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Phantom Squad</strong></i> is inspired by some amazing games: <i><strong>Doorkickers</strong></i>, <i><strong>Ready or Not</strong></i>, <strong><i>Rainbow Six Siege</i></strong> and many other amazing tactical shooters! Check them out too if you haven't already!</p>","developers":["Ctrl Freak"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841770/731a8de1b9aba015c87c805bff4cd902e153dc89/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1756827971","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Phantom Squad \u00a9 Developed by Ctrl Freak. Published by Super Rare Originals. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257168575,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168575/movie480.mp4?t=1752836135","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168575/movie_max.mp4?t=1752836135"},"name":"Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257168575/ee28961a0f4343742134379165f28cc198883cdd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752836135","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168575/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752836135","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168575/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1752836135"}}],"name":"Phantom Squad","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Phantom Squad - $13.99 USD","packageid":1013973,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":1399}],"title":"Buy Phantom Squad"}],"packages":[1013973],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 2500 or AMD FX-4350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> nVidia GTX 660ti or AMD R9 270 with 2+ GB of VRA